### Next Steps for User

To enable Analytics on Vercel:
1. Navigate to your Vercel project dashboard
2. Click on "Analytics" in the sidebar
3. Click the "Enable" button to activate Analytics

The code implementation is complete and ready. Once enabled in the Vercel dashboard, analytics data will be collected automatically after the next deployment.

